{"id":88,"slug":"88-combinator-selectors-space-khac-nhau","category":"CSS","subcategory":"Selectors","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) khác nhau?","question_en":"How do combinator selectors (>, +, ~, space) differ?","answer_vi":"Bốn combinator mô tả **quan hệ giữa hai element**:\n\n```html\n<div>\n  <p>A</p>          <!-- con trực tiếp -->\n  <section>\n    <p>B</p>        <!-- cháu -->\n  </section>\n  <h2>C</h2>\n  <p>D</p>          <!-- anh em ngay sau h2 -->\n  <p>E</p>          <!-- anh em sau h2, không liền kề -->\n</div>\n```\n\n```css\ndiv p     { }   /* A, B, D, E — mọi con cháu */\ndiv > p   { }   /* A, D, E — chỉ con TRỰC TIẾP */\nh2 + p    { }   /* D — anh em LIỀN NGAY SAU */\nh2 ~ p    { }   /* D, E — mọi anh em SAU nó */\n```\n\n| Ký hiệu | Tên | Quan hệ |\n|---|---|---|\n| khoảng trắng | descendant | con cháu bất kỳ cấp |\n| `>` | child | con trực tiếp |\n| `+` | adjacent sibling | anh em kế ngay sau |\n| `~` | general sibling | mọi anh em phía sau |\n\nDùng thực tế nhiều nhất là `+` cho khoảng cách giữa các phần tử liên tiếp:\n\n```css\n.list > * + * { margin-top: 12px; }   /* mọi phần tử trừ cái đầu */\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** `+` và `~` **chỉ nhìn về phía sau**. Không có combinator \"anh em phía trước\" — muốn style element đứng trước thì phải dùng `:has()` (`h2:has(+ p)`)","answer_en":"Four combinators describe **the relationship between two elements**:\n\n```html\n<div>\n  <p>A</p>          <!-- direct child -->\n  <section>\n    <p>B</p>        <!-- grandchild -->\n  </section>\n  <h2>C</h2>\n  <p>D</p>          <!-- sibling immediately after h2 -->\n  <p>E</p>          <!-- later sibling, not adjacent -->\n</div>\n```\n\n```css\ndiv p     { }   /* A, B, D, E — any descendant */\ndiv > p   { }   /* A, D, E — DIRECT children only */\nh2 + p    { }   /* D — the IMMEDIATELY following sibling */\nh2 ~ p    { }   /* D, E — every following sibling */\n```\n\n| Symbol | Name | Relationship |\n|---|---|---|\n| space | descendant | any depth below |\n| `>` | child | direct child |\n| `+` | adjacent sibling | the next sibling |\n| `~` | general sibling | all later siblings |\n\nThe most common real use is `+` for spacing between consecutive items:\n\n```css\n.list > * + * { margin-top: 12px; }   /* every element except the first */\n```\n\n**Note:** `+` and `~` **only look forward**. There is no \"previous sibling\" combinator — to style an element that comes before, reach for `:has()` (`h2:has(+ p)`)","answer_html_vi":"<p>Bốn combinator mô tả <strong>quan hệ giữa hai element</strong>:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;div&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;A&lt;/p&gt;          &lt;!-- con trực tiếp --&gt;\n  &lt;section&gt;\n    &lt;p&gt;B&lt;/p&gt;        &lt;!-- cháu --&gt;\n  &lt;/section&gt;\n  &lt;h2&gt;C&lt;/h2&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;D&lt;/p&gt;          &lt;!-- anh em ngay sau h2 --&gt;\n  &lt;p&gt;E&lt;/p&gt;          &lt;!-- anh em sau h2, không liền kề --&gt;\n&lt;/div&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>A<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- con trực tiếp --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n    <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>B<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>        <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- cháu --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">section</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>C<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">h2</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>D<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- anh em ngay sau h2 --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>E<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- anh em sau h2, không liền kề --&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">div</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"div p     { }   /* A, B, D, E — mọi con cháu */\ndiv &gt; p   { }   /* A, D, E — chỉ con TRỰC TIẾP */\nh2 + p    { }   /* D — anh em LIỀN NGAY SAU */\nh2 ~ p    { }   /* D, E — mọi anh em SAU nó */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span>     { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* A, B, D, E — mọi con cháu */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">div</span> &gt; <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span>   { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* A, D, E — chỉ con TRỰC TIẾP */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h2</span> + <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span>    { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* D — anh em LIỀN NGAY SAU */</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">h2</span> ~ <span class=\"hljs-selector-tag\">p</span>    { }   <span class=\"hljs-comment\">/* D, E — mọi anh em SAU nó */</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-table-wrap\"><table class=\"qa-table\"><thead><tr><th>Ký hiệu</th><th>Tên</th><th>Quan hệ</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>khoảng trắng</td><td>descendant</td><td>con cháu bất kỳ cấp</td></tr><tr><td><code>&gt;</code></td><td>child</td><td>con trực tiếp</td></tr><tr><td><code>+</code></td><td>adjacent sibling</td><td>anh em kế ngay sau</td></tr><tr><td><code>~</code></td><td>general sibling</td><td>mọi anh em phía sau</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p class=\"qa-summary\">Dùng thực tế nhiều nhất là <code>+</code> cho khoảng cách giữa các phần tử liên tiếp:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">css</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\".list &gt; * + * { margin-top: 12px; }   /* mọi phần tử trừ cái đầu */\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"